@startuml ssd7-export-availability
title SSD - Export Availability to CSV (success and failure scenarios)
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor ":AdministrativeStaff" as staff
participant ":System" as sys

note over staff, sys : Precondition: staff is identified and authenticated

staff -> sys : exportAvailability(filePath)
alt availability exists and file written (main)
    sys --> staff : export summary: number of slots written
else no availability in the system (FAILURE)
    sys --> staff : nothing to export
    note over staff, sys : Use case ends; no file is written
else file cannot be written (FAILURE)
    sys --> staff : cannot write file
    note over staff, sys : Use case ends
end

@enduml
